      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Attribute to specify if ims registration is of type normal or emergency.</para>
          <para>For emergency registration bit will be set. For normal registration bit will not be set. This flag is only applicable when listening to emergency IMS registration state updates via the ImsMmTelManager#registerImsEmergencyRegistrationCallback API</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/telephony/ims/ImsRegistrationAttributes#ATTR_REGISTRATION_TYPE_EMERGENCY" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.telephony.ims.ImsRegistrationAttributes.ATTR_REGISTRATION_TYPE_EMERGENCY</code>.</a></format></para>
