      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Attribute to specify if virtual registration is required.</para>
          <para>If emergency registration is not required for making emergency call, in such cases bit will be set and callback will represent virtual registration status update. This flag is only applicable when listening to emergency IMS registration state updates via the ImsMmTelManager#registerImsEmergencyRegistrationCallback API</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/telephony/ims/ImsRegistrationAttributes#ATTR_VIRTUAL_FOR_ANONYMOUS_EMERGENCY_CALL" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.telephony.ims.ImsRegistrationAttributes.ATTR_VIRTUAL_FOR_ANONYMOUS_EMERGENCY_CALL</code>.</a></format></para>
